  "structure": {
    "block_count": 93,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "Eating Vegetarian and Vegan During Pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "9d2bfc26c7a6d40a727a7ed5303007e86bc7dfac0d65933f191ae0bf35a5712c",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "pregnant vegetarian woman preparing vegan meal",
        "text_sha256": "20c2e47f1794f6a13d363df24a88e0df1c9265095d9752c492ceda98d89516aa",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here's how to get the protein and other key nutrients you need without forgoing your diet during pregnancy.",
        "text_sha256": "7ddb28ac2c3746a825168b25141fd8dd6116e61641068b38fbb0b368d95a53ab",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Lots of things will change with the anticipation (and eventual arrival!) of your baby — but if you've decided against eating animal-derived foods, your diet doesn't need to be one of them.",
        "text_sha256": "181d20744a4965f2fdad318ec38b7f83b7f6be4c6bf74999e6aee4bf27dd755d",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You can stick to a vegetarian or vegan diet when you’re pregnant. Here's what you should know to make sure you and your baby are still getting everything you need nutritionally.",
        "text_sha256": "acf98f6eabc75e2719d86e908deae9d39096a791e256cd30507bff39caf247c0",
        "word_count": 31
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Can I still follow a vegetarian or vegan diet when I'm pregnant?",
        "text_sha256": "5dd49f41449d5098c0c2e078b93382d0bfae6872c04d014a9887ba7b5d8edd9f",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Don't be surprised if you come across well-meaning naysayers; there are still so many misconceptions about vegetarian and vegan diets during pregnancy. In truth, vegetarians and vegans have perfectly healthy pregnancies and babies.",
        "text_sha256": "9065422c3422e2d5e1ab83941a88ba4eb57db1dcc23ec36fb45e6947e7cb85b5",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Why is there any concern at all? Some of the most vital baby-boosting nutrients are more easily found in meats and other animal-based products. But it's still a cinch to get them elsewhere.",
        "text_sha256": "a08c1999e989bd2a696903b4e6f7cecead00b60bda5f45866f8571dc54af384b",
        "word_count": 33
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "What nutrients will I need to monitor when I'm pregnant and vegan or vegetarian?",
        "text_sha256": "7c80097af81fd7892829bedb60d9a3d26953e4d98c9ab5426d077931df86e7a1",
        "word_count": 14
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You'll want to remain mindful of your protein, calcium, iron, vitamin B12 and vitamin D intake when you're expecting and adhering to a vegetarian or vegan diet.",
        "text_sha256": "37d531062782b653d94214444c4b80da272756e799186e32e243522411dbd3fc",
        "word_count": 27
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "Protein",
        "text_sha256": "92a31f1de3dff9a0e811b843fad05810b64bc0f4bb3163d6c2d811623b96e3a7",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Expecting women need more protein than ever — that's because this essential nutrient helps build cells and make hormones for your growing baby.",
        "text_sha256": "ec66eeb7d52af978346d947b0614870a88931349fcfec7f6cd1f5f6035502708",
        "word_count": 23
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "If you’re a dairy- and egg-eating vegetarian, you may already get what you need from potent protein sources (craving more omelets and Greek yogurt now that you're pregnant?). If you're worried you're not getting enough or adhere to veganism, there are plenty of veggie-based proteins to emphasize in your diet.",
        "text_sha256": "1e4608d4841bf21d289118009600d6fbabfb46ffac7c0537aa517a4a452f610f",
        "word_count": 50
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "How much: at least 75 grams per day (depending on your individual needs)",
        "text_sha256": "ee739055c67dffb10426c174dbda80da2b24ec60169596536afbf6b2cd1b0c7c",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Best plant-based protein sources for vegans or vegetarians to eat during pregnancy:",
        "text_sha256": "223af2e48483ca0a7f31bebf9adfaeecca9e8fa52e9999f012a7505d628775c9",
        "word_count": 12
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Split or green peas",
        "text_sha256": "2b6f8f8c1c980f707376604296b544c799617774a49c7e6eb4d6697ea4a56bca",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Chickpeas",
        "text_sha256": "45d661d6c33c3983c5b064ffd2d203b092c2c2523c36fc13dac6c54691371bc7",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Black, navy, kidney or pinto beans",
        "text_sha256": "390766b68b822b23543b64efe0a4b6e8a363a3b360290e1ed293d3b91a05dcdb",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
